# Mocks are generated subclasses rather than Mockito's default inline mocks. An inline mock
# redefines its class in the running JVM, which gets slow once a test JVM has loaded the Quarkus
# applications of the classes that ran before. A final class, record or enum cannot be subclassed:
# mock one with InlineMocks.inlineMock(...) or @Mock(mockMaker = MockMakers.INLINE), and prefer a
# real instance of a record.
mock-maker-subclass
